## ARCHITECTURE.md

```markdown
# Architecture

The authoritative harness config is this plugin's docs-adjacent metadata file at `docs/harness-engineering/harness-engineering.json`.

## Source Roots

| Root | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| src | Application source |

## Layer Model

This repository documents its layer model here. The default example is `types -> config -> repo -> service -> runtime -> ui`; replace it when the repository uses a different model.

## Project Profiles

Project-specific docs may name source roots, test roots, schema source paths, generated artifact policy, and enforcement details. Keep that metadata in this architecture doc, guardrail docs, or a target-specific integration file unless a separate integration pack owns a machine-readable extension.

## Enforcement Levels

Each setting-level rule names its severity, evidence path, and validator surface in the docs that own that rule.

## Checks

| Check | Command | Scope |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Harness validation | `sh scripts/harness/validate_harness.sh` | Config, docs, scripts, CI, hooks, readiness, and generated-doc provenance |
| User requirement rules | configured rule validation | Product specs, acceptance criteria, generated boundaries |
```

